      "id": 2,
      "title": "OpxDemon 6.0 \u2014 Rootless engine & Debian",
      "description": "The full toolset now runs without root: OpxDemon boots an arm64 QEMU virtual machine and routes tools into the guest. The chroot moved from Alpine to Debian trixie, the same rootfs the VM boots. Also new: a root-free network scanner (mDNS, SSDP, NetBIOS, SNMP), Cameradar RTSP discovery, a reworked dashboard and VM settings. RouterScan has been removed. arm64-v8a only.",
